<section class="sec wrap">
  <div class="sh rv">
    <div class="top"><span class="u10 mute">03 — Group Policy</span><a class="tl" href="/policies/">All policies</a></div>
    <h2 class="big">The details</h2>
    <p class="say">Group bookings work a little differently from a single appointment. Here's exactly what to expect.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="acc rv">
    <div class="acc-i open"><button class="acc-b" type="button" aria-expanded="true">Confirmation<span class="sg"></span></button>
      <div class="acc-p"><p>After you book, our team reaches out within 24 hours to confirm. Requests aren't guaranteed until confirmed.</p></div></div>
    <div class="acc-i"><button class="acc-b" type="button" aria-expanded="false">Payment<span class="sg"></span></button>
      <div class="acc-p"><p>A credit card holds all group appointments, with a deposit to secure your reservation. The balance is charged on the day of your booking. Advance payment may be required for services totaling $80+ per guest.</p></div></div>
    <div class="acc-i"><button class="acc-b" type="button" aria-expanded="false">Cancellation &amp; changes<span class="sg"></span></button>
      <div class="acc-p"><p>We ask for at least 48 hours' notice for any change, including guest count. With notice, your deposit carries to your new date. Within 48 hours, your deposit is retained. No-shows may be charged up to 50%.</p></div></div>
    <div class="acc-i"><button class="acc-b" type="button" aria-expanded="false">Running late<span class="sg"></span></button>
      <div class="acc-p"><p>Let us know as soon as you can and we'll do our best to accommodate. Shortened services due to late arrival are charged at the scheduled rate.</p></div></div>
    <div class="acc-i"><button class="acc-b" type="button" aria-expanded="false">Food &amp; drink<span class="sg"></span></button>
      <div class="acc-p"><p>Light food and drink are permitted with advance notice for standard bookings. Anything is welcome for private events.</p></div></div>
  </div>
</section>
